      "text": "Measured: replicas 1 \u2192 3 \u2192 1 (back to 1 in 38-40s after the ramp ends)\np50 12 ms at 1 client \u2192 205-210 ms at 20 \u00b7 \u2248 90-94 req/s \u00b7 0 errors\nthe cap is the single Serve proxy (1 core), not the replicas",
